      <title type="html">Home switches comparison</title>
      <link href="https://tevinzhang.com/en/home-switches-comparison/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Home switches comparison" />
      <published>2024-06-03T00:00:00+08:00</published>
      <updated>2026-01-25T22:50:08+08:00</updated>
      <id>https://tevinzhang.com/en/home-switches-comparison</id>
      
      

      
      
      
      
      

      <author>
          <name>Tevin Zhang</name>
        
          <email>hey(at)tevinzhang(dot)com</email>
        
        
      </author>

      
        
      

      

      
      
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[The requirement is VLAN single-line multiplexing. Although IPTV is not needed, I need to switch the network port in the weak current box to a router in another room through a single line, while also accommodating dial-up. Gigabit switching is adequate and a more practical choice after considering the current popularity and cost effectiveness of higher bandwidth devices.]]></summary>
      

      
      
        
